  [1m1 — Fixed.[0m [38;5;153m<=[39m → [38;5;153m<[39m at [38;5;153msrc/ratelimit/limiter.py:23[39m. Both tests pass, [38;5;153mruff[39m and [38;5;153mmypy[39m clean. No new test added:
